'''Oversleeping Beauty Punt''' (ひたすら眠れるケリの美女, ''Hitasura nemureru keri no bijo'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Oversleeping Beauty Punt
|image = E 335.png
|appearance = [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,600¢ - 10,270¢
}}

==Enemy==
Oversleeping Beauty Punt is rather tanky supporting 800,000 health, however, their attack is somewhat low being at 8,500.  The range of Oversleeping Beauty Punt shouldn't cause too much of a threat as long as the player has units with range above 350. The speed of this enemy is nothing to worry about being at 5, meaning that it will slowly advance towards the players base giving them time to prepare and stack units to defeat it.

==Strategy==
Any units that have a range of above 350 such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], its [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], etc can defeat this enemy easily as long as the player is protecting them using meatshields.

